==Battleground==
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is one of the only Relic-focused stages in the entire event, so using anti-Relic units that would otherwise not find usage such as [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha Bun]] or [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Yulala]] is highly recommended here.

